# kwesi
===
 Kwesi — a local-first desktop app for generating and training music with open-source AI models. No cloud, no accounts. Bundles MusicGen, MuseCoco, ACE-Step 1.5, RAVE, Museformer, and YuE2 behind one dynamic UI. Electron + React + Python sidecar servers.
